摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Three DSH tools that let any agent — including a team member — list, steer and stop the subagents it started.","id":"gh:1433239342","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-subagent-control","slug":"SpaceRelay/dsh-subagent-control","topics":["deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-desktop","deepseek-harness-plugin","deepseek-harness-plugins","dsh","dsh-desktop","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-desktop","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Three DSH tools that let any agent — including a team member — list, steer and stop the subagents it"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" tools that let any agent — including a team member — list, steer and stop the subagents it started."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-subagent-control"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Three tools that let any DSH agent — **including a team member** — list, steer and stop the subagent"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"hat let any DSH agent — **including a team member** — list, steer and stop the subagents it started."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`list_subagents` · `send_subagent_message` · `interrupt_subagent`"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### The problem"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The Harness ships `list_agents`, `send_message` and `interrupt_agent`. When the Agent Team bundle is"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" active, it registers tools with **those same three names** in every team member's exact Agent scope"},{"id":"p8s3","text":", and the more specific registration wins. Inside a teammate scope the team versions take over: they"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" resolve `target` against the team roster only, and interrupting is a Lead-only operation."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The result: a teammate can start a subagent with `subagent`, but cannot list it, follow up with it, "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"or stop it — even though the subagent service (`ctx.subagents`) has supported all three for any live"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" agent all along, and its authority rules already allow an ancestor to manage its own descendants."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"This bundle does not fight over the taken names. It registers three **new** names, globally, so the "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"Lead and every teammate get them at once."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Tools"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Tool | Parameters | Underlying call |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `list_subagents` | `scope?`: `\"children\"` \\| `\"descendants\"` (default `children`) | `ctx.subagents"},{"id":"p13s2","text":".listChildren()` / `listDescendants()` |\n| `send_subagent_message` | `subagent_id`, `message` (both "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"required) | `ctx.subagents.sendMessage()` |\n| `interrupt_subagent` | `subagent_id` (required) | `ctx"},{"id":"p13s4","text":".subagents.interrupt()` with ancestor authority |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Usage"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Each listing line is `id  status  \"label\"  depth=`. `status` is `running` or `inactive` — **inactive"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" means no turn is executing, not that the subagent is gone**. Use `send_subagent_message` to wake it"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"means no turn is executing, not that the subagent is gone**. Use `send_subagent_message` to wake it."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Team members are continuable subagents too, so they also appear in this list, marked `team=teammate`"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" (or `team=lead`). Pass `include_teammates: false` when you want only the plain subagents you starte"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"or `team=lead`). Pass `include_teammates: false` when you want only the plain subagents you started."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Behaviour and limits"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **One-shot subagents are hidden.** They cannot accept a follow-up message, so listing them would o"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"nly invite a call that is guaranteed to fail.\n- **A broken record is reported, not thrown.** A child"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" whose state cannot be read comes back as a diagnostic entry (`corrupt` / `unsupported` / `unavailab"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"le`) instead of turning the whole listing into an error.\n- **`send_subagent_message` reaches direct "},{"id":"p19s5","text":"children only.** That is the service's own rule; the plugin does not widen it.\n- **`interrupt_subage"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"nt` reaches descendants**, so a team Lead can also stop a grandchild.\n- **Every failure names its ca"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"use**: no calling agent, unknown id, or an id that is not yours.\n- **No config, no storage.** The bu"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"ndle writes nothing and reads nothing outside the three services."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Through the plugin panel / market, or by asking the agent:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"From a checkout, pass the **directory path** instead of the npm spec. The bundle applies immediately"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" — no restart needed. Afterwards the three tool names are visible and the plugin row is enabled."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Compatibility"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- DSH with the `tools`, `subagents` and `agents` services (0.2.x and later).\n- Node `^22.19.0 || >=2"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"4.0.0`.\n- **Zero dependencies** — no runtime dependency, no peer dependency, not a single `import`. "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"The tools are plain tool-table objects with explicit JSON Schemas, so they install and behave identi"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"cally from npm or from a linked checkout."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Name collisions"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"`dsh-subagent-library` also registers a global `list_subagents` tool. Two global registrations of on"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"e name cannot both win: install one of them, or remember that the other may shadow this one."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The three new names were chosen precisely because they do **not** collide with the built-in `list_ag"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ents` / `send_message` / `interrupt_agent`."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Remove or disable the bundle in the plugin panel. Nothing is left behind."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Optional components (each off by default)"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Four extra tools ship as **separate components**, each with its own row and switch in the plugin\npan"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"el (`Cross-layer relay`, `Wait for subagents`, `Release subagents`, `Delegation budget`).\nAll four s"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"tart disabled; turning one on registers exactly one tool, so you can enable only what\nyou need."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Component | Tool | What it does | Risk |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Cross-layer relay | `relay_subagent_message` | Best-effort message to a deeper descendant: deliver"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ed to the first hop with a request to forward it down | intermediate agents may summarize; not guara"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"nteed |\n| Wait for subagents | `wait_subagents` | Wait for descendants (bounded by `timeout_seconds`"},{"id":"p34s4","text":") instead of ending your turn first | blocks up to the timeout |\n| Release subagents | `drain_subage"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"nts` | Stop **and release** direct children, unlike `interrupt_subagent`, which only stops the curre"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"nt turn | a released child cannot be woken by a message |\n| Delegation budget | `subagent_budget` | "},{"id":"p34s7","text":"Read-only report: depth limit, how deep the tree goes, running/inactive counts | none |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"A separate companion bundle, `dsh-team-limits`,\nraises the Agent Team limits (members, tasks, messag"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"e bytes). It is a separate install on\npurpose: it overrides the shipped `agent-team` row, and that s"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"hould never happen implicitly."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"A second companion bundle, `dsh-human-wait`,\nstops the PTC `run_code` deadline from counting the tim"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"e you spend answering a question, reviewing\na plan or approving a request. PTC mode wraps the whole "},{"id":"p36s3","text":"program — nested tool and approval waits\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### 兼容性"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- 具备 `tools`、`subagents`、`agents` 三个服务的 DSH（0.2.x 及以上）。\n- Node `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0`。\n- **零依赖**：没有运"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"行时依赖、没有 peer 依赖，模块里一行 `import` 都没有。工具是带显式 JSON Schema 的普通定义对象，所以 npm 安装与软链安装行为完全一致。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
